Package: perturbRNet
Type: Package
Title: Perturbation Response Networks for Single-Cell and Single-Nucleus Omics
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Wei", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "wei09128@gmail.com")
Description: Constructs perturbation response fingerprints and signed,
    context-resolved networks from donor-aware pseudobulk differential
    analyses. Separates net molecular response from reinforcing and
    counterdirectional regulatory input, and reports the evidence level of
    every directed edge. Designed for scRNA-seq and snRNA-seq experiments
    containing arbitrary perturbations, doses, times, cell types, and
    biological contexts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    Matrix,
    edgeR,
    limma,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
